# A pattern file: one regular expression to a line, matched on `hdr(user-agent)`.
# Loaded by `acl waf_user_agent` in waf.cfg.

# CRS 932131 (rce)
\$(?:\((?:[^\)]+|\([^\)]+\))\)|\{[^\}]+\}|\[[^\]]*\])|[<>]\([^\)]+\)|/[0-9A-Z_a-z]*\[[^\]]+\]
